  "id": "BIT-tomcat-2026-65183",
  "summary": "Apache Tomcat: TOCTOU when setting specific permissions for Unix Domain Sockets",
  "details": "Time-of-check Time-of-use (TOCTOU) Race Condition vulnerability in Apache Tomcat when creating unix domain sockets allows an unauthorised local user to access the unix domain socket.\n\n\n\nThis issue affects Apache Tomcat: from 11.0.0 through 11.0.24, from 10.1.0 through 10.1.57, from 9.0.42 through 9.0.120.\n\n\n\nUsers are recommended to upgrade to version 11.0.25, 10.1.58, 9.0.121, which fixes the issue.",
